# KapsGerman — Complete Personalized AI Learning System with Google Docs Synchronization, Vocabulary Mastery and Adaptive Practice

## 0. MISSION — BUILD THE COMPLETE FEATURE

Repository: **EmirGan1/KapsApp4**

Application: **KapsApp → KapsGerman**

Implement a complete new feature called **Personalized Learning (Kişisel Çalışma)** inside the existing KapsGerman application.

This feature must allow every user to build a private, personalized German-learning environment from their own German–Turkish vocabulary lists, classroom notes, phrases, expressions, and sentences.

Users must be able to:

1. Paste German–Turkish notes directly.
2. Create and edit vocabulary lists manually.
3. Connect Google Docs documents.
4. Upload supported text-based documents.
5. Automatically synchronize connected documents.
6. Extract vocabulary and phrases using AI.
7. Analyze vocabulary difficulty using CEFR levels.
8. Generate unlimited variations of meaningful practice questions.
9. Study through flashcards, matching, multiple choice, translation, spelling, true/false, sentence construction, and other exercises.
10. Take a comprehensive mixed test covering every vocabulary item in a selected source.
11. Track individual vocabulary mastery across all exercise types.
12. See exactly how much of each personal document has been learned.
13. Continue previous sessions without losing progress.
14. Automatically incorporate newly added vocabulary when documents change.

**The main educational objective is long-term vocabulary retention through varied, meaningful, AI-generated practice — not merely memorizing repeated questions.**

This must be a fully functional, persistent, production-ready system, not a UI mockup.

